  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/e306d0edaa1c360a9dc63af39b3f34da9440d14853e714d54d6553647fbc3ba8.png] \n\nGiven equation: 242 * 11 * 76 * 34 * 2 * 32 \n\nOption 1) ÷ − + × = \n\nAfter replacing the * signs with mathematical signs:\n\n⇒ __**242 ÷ 11**__ - 76 + 34 × 2 = 32 \n\n⇒ 22 - 76 + __**34 × 2**__ = 32 \n\n⇒ __**22**__ - 76 + __68__ = 32 \n\n⇒ __**90 - 76**__ = 32 \n\n⇒ 14 = 32 \n\nOption 2) ÷ + −× = \n\nAfter replacing the * signs with mathematical signs:\n\n⇒ __**242 ÷ 11**__ + 76 - 34 × 2 = 32 \n\n⇒ 22 + 76 - __**34 × 2**__ = 32 \n\n⇒ __**22 + 76**__ - 68 = 32 \n\n⇒ __98____** - 68**__ = 32 \n\n⇒ 30 = 32 \n\nOption 3) + ÷ − = × \n\nAfter replacing the * signs with mathematical signs:\n\n⇒ 242 + __**11 ÷ 76**__ - 34 = 2 × 32 \n\n⇒ __**242 + 0.14**__ - 34 = __**2 × 32**__ \n\n⇒ __**242.14 - 34**__ = 64\n\n⇒ 208.14 = 64\n\n**Option 4) ÷ + − = ×**\n\nAfter replacing the * signs with mathematical signs:\n\n⇒ __**242 ÷ 11**__ + 76 - 34 = 2 × 32 \n\n⇒ __**22 + 76**__ - 34 = __**2 × 32 **__\n\n⇒ __**98 - 34**__ = 64\n\n⇒ **64 = 64**\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"÷ + − = ×\".",
